urce srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wilting_Alex\" title=\"Wilting Alex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png/25px-Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png/38px-Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png/50px-Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wilting Alex\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png/25px-Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wilting_Alex\" title=\"Wilting Alex\">Wilting Alex</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_Ruins\" title=\"Undercity Ruins\">Undercity Ruins</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-65&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1041</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The Effigy of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Amelyssan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amelyssan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Amelyssan\">Amelyssan</a></span>, who grasped divinity.<br><br>\nWhat use her betrayal? She thought herself perfect, but forgot the one she served.<br><br>\n[Below is an exaggerated signature, written in blood]<br><br>\nOrin the Red\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194817\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1792/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21038/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6557/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 933682/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.192      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   36.192      1 -total\n 44.27%   16.023      8 Template:Icon_text\n 34.98%   12.661     17 Template:Trim\n 24.00%    8.687      4 Template:Icon_link\n 17.55%    6.352      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.53%    4.898      2 Template:CharLink\n 12.77%    4.622      8 Template:Ifempty\n 12.38%    4.479      1 Template:Ifexist\n 